    "# Module 4: Component Integration Tests - Part 11\n",
    "## Orchestrator Integration Testing: Metadata Persistence & State Management\n",
    "\n",
    "**Focus**: Metadata persistence and state management testing in `test_orchestrator_integration.py` (lines 620-660).\n",
    "\n",
    "### Learning Objectives\n",
    "- Master metadata file creation and loading patterns\n",
    "- Understand state persistence across pipeline operations\n",
    "- Learn cross-stage data continuity testing strategies\n",
    "- Analyze file-based state management validation"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Metadata Persistence Test Architecture\n",
    "\n",
    "### State Management Focus\n",
    "```python\n",
    "def test_metadata_persistence_between_stages(self, temp_workspace, sample_openspec):\n",
    "    \"\"\"Test metadata persistence between pipeline stages.\"\"\"\n",
    "    print(\"\\n🧪 Testing metadata persistence between stages...\")\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Method Analysis:**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### No Mocking Strategy\n",
    "**Pure State Management Testing:**\n",
    "- **No patches**: Focus on file-based state management\n",
    "- **Real I/O operations**: Actual file creation and reading\n",
    "- **State transitions**: How data persists between operations\n",
    "- **File system integration**: Real metadata file handling\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Standard Parameter Pattern\n",
    "```python\n",
    "def test_metadata_persistence_between_stages(self, temp_workspace, sample_openspec):\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Complete Dependencies:**\n",
    "- **`self`**: Instance method\n",
    "- **`temp_workspace`**: Working directory for file operations\n",
    "- **`sample_openspec`**: Specification for metadata content\n",
    "- **No mocks**: Real file system operations\n",
    "\n",
    "#### State Management Focus\n",
    "**What's Being Tested:**\n",
    "- **Metadata file creation**: How pipeline state is saved\n",
    "- **Metadata loading**: How state is restored between operations\n",
    "- **State consistency**: Data integrity across save/load cycles\n",
    "- **Cross-stage continuity**: Information flow between pipeline stages"
   ]
  },
