   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 2. Initial State Validation\n",
    "\n",
    "### Clean State Testing\n",
    "```python\n",
    "    orchestrator = IntegrationOrchestrator(base_dir=temp_workspace)\n",
    "    \n",
    "    # Initially no spec file path\n",
    "    assert orchestrator.spec_file_path is None\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Initial State Analysis:**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Fresh Orchestrator State\n",
    "```python\n",
    "orchestrator = IntegrationOrchestrator(base_dir=temp_workspace)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Clean Initialization:**\n",
    "- **Fresh instance**: New orchestrator for each test\n",
    "- **No prior state**: No previous operations\n",
    "- **Default values**: All attributes at initial values\n",
    "- **Workspace isolation**: Test-specific directory\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Initial State Validation\n",
    "```python\n",
    "assert orchestrator.spec_file_path is None\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**State Contract Testing:**\n",
    "- **`spec_file_path`**: Key state attribute for pipeline continuity\n",
    "- **Initial value**: `None` indicates no spec loaded\n",
    "- **Type validation**: `is None` vs `== None` (identity check)\n",
    "- **Baseline establishment**: Starting point for state changes\n",
    "\n",
    "#### State Management Importance\n",
    "**Why Test Initial State?**\n",
    "- **Baseline verification**: Confirm clean starting point\n",
    "- **State contract**: Document initial behavior\n",
    "- **Isolation guarantee**: No state pollution between tests\n",
    "- **Regression prevention**: Catch initialization changes"
   ]
