    "## 3. Metadata File Creation\n",
    "\n",
    "### Manual Metadata Setup\n",
    "```python\n",
    "    # Create metadata in the correct location\n",
    "    reports_dir = Path.cwd() / \"reports\"\n",
    "    reports_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "    metadata_file = reports_dir / \"pipeline_metadata.json\"\n",
    "    \n",
    "    metadata = {\n",
    "        \"spec_file_path\": str(sample_openspec.absolute()),\n",
    "        \"stage_completed\": \"stage1\",\n",
    "        \"timestamp\": datetime.now().isoformat()\n",
    "    }\n",
    "    \n",
    "    metadata_file.write_text(json.dumps(metadata, indent=2))\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Metadata Creation Analysis:**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### File Location Strategy\n",
    "```python\n",
    "reports_dir = Path.cwd() / \"reports\"\n",
    "metadata_file = reports_dir / \"pipeline_metadata.json\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Global Location Choice:**\n",
    "- **`Path.cwd()`**: Uses current working directory, not test workspace\n",
    "- **Production alignment**: Matches real orchestrator behavior\n",
    "- **Cross-test persistence**: Metadata available across test runs\n",
    "- **Manual cleanup**: Test must clean up global file\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Directory Creation\n",
    "```python\n",
    "reports_dir.mkdir(parents=True, exist_ok=True)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Robust Directory Setup:**\n",
    "- **`parents=True`**: Creates parent directories if needed\n",
    "- **`exist_ok=True`**: No error if directory already exists\n",
    "- **Idempotent operation**: Safe to run multiple times\n",
    "- **Test isolation**: Works in clean or existing environments\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Metadata Content Design\n",
    "```python\n",
    "metadata = {\n",
    "    \"spec_file_path\": str(sample_openspec.absolute()),\n",
    "    \"stage_completed\": \"stage1\",\n",
    "    \"timestamp\": datetime.now().isoformat()\n",
    "}\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Complete Metadata Structure:**\n",
    "- **`spec_file_path`**: Absolute path to specification file\n",
    "- **`stage_completed`**: Last completed pipeline stage\n",
    "- **`timestamp`**: ISO format timestamp for audit trail\n",
    "- **JSON serializable**: Ready for file storage\n",
    "\n",
    "#### File Writing Strategy\n",
    "```python\n",
    "metadata_file.write_text(json.dumps(metadata, indent=2))\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**File Creation Pattern:**\n",
    "- **JSON serialization**: `json.dumps()` with formatting\n",
    "- **Human readable**: `indent=2` for debugging\n",
    "- **Atomic write**: Single file write operation\n",
    "- **Overwrite**: Replaces existing metadata"
   ]
  },
