    "## 4. Metadata Loading Validation\n",
    "\n",
    "### State Restoration Testing\n",
    "```python\n",
    "    # Load metadata\n",
    "    result = orchestrator.load_spec_file_path_from_metadata()\n",
    "    \n",
    "    assert result == True\n",
    "    assert orchestrator.spec_file_path == sample_openspec.absolute()\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Loading Analysis:**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Metadata Loading Method\n",
    "```python\n",
    "result = orchestrator.load_spec_file_path_from_metadata()\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Method Contract:**\n",
    "- **Return value**: Boolean success indicator\n",
    "- **Side effect**: Updates `orchestrator.spec_file_path`\n",
    "- **File reading**: Reads metadata from standard location\n",
    "- **State restoration**: Loads previous pipeline state\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Success Validation\n",
    "```python\n",
    "assert result == True\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Loading Success Criteria:**\n",
    "- **File found**: Metadata file exists and readable\n",
    - **Valid JSON**: File contains valid JSON structure\n",
    "- **Required fields**: Expected metadata keys present\n",
    "- **Path validation**: Spec file path exists and accessible\n",
    "\n",
    "#### State Change Validation\n",
    "```python\n",
    "assert orchestrator.spec_file_path == sample_openspec.absolute()\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**State Restoration Proof:**\n",
    "- **Initial state**: Was `None` before loading\n",
    "- **Final state**: Now contains absolute spec path\n",
    "- **Correct value**: Matches metadata file content\n",
    "- **Type consistency**: Path object vs string comparison\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Data Integrity Verification\n",
    "**What This Proves:**\n",
    "- **File reading**: Metadata file successfully read\n",
    "- **JSON parsing**: Content correctly deserialized\n",
    "- **State assignment**: Orchestrator state updated\n",
    "- **Path resolution**: Absolute path correctly stored"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 5. Idempotent Loading Testing\n",
    "\n",
    "### Repeated Loading Validation\n",
    "```python\n",
    "    # Test that subsequent calls don't reload (already loaded)\n",
    "    result = orchestrator.load_spec_file_path_from_metadata()\n",
    "    assert result == True  # Should return True since already loaded\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Idempotent Behavior Analysis:**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Repeated Method Call\n",
    "```python\n",
    "result = orchestrator.load_spec_file_path_from_metadata()\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Second Loading Scenario:**\n",
    "- **State already loaded**: `spec_file_path` already set\n",
    "- **Same method**: Identical call to first loading\n",
    "- **Expected behavior**: Should not reload from file\n",
    "- **Performance optimization**: Avoid unnecessary file I/O\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Success Response Validation\n",
    "```python\n",
    "assert result == True  # Should return True since already loaded\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Idempotent Success Criteria:**\n",
    "- **Same response**: Returns `True` like first call\n",
    "- **No error**: Doesn't fail because state already loaded\n",
    "- **Consistent interface**: Same success contract\n",
    "- **State preservation**: Doesn't change existing state\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Idempotent Benefits\n",
    "**Why Test Idempotency?**\n",
    "- **Performance**: Avoid repeated file I/O\n",
    "- **Safety**: Multiple calls don't cause issues\n",
    "- **Reliability**: Consistent behavior regardless of call count\n",
    "- **Robustness**: Handles repeated operations gracefully"
   ]
  },
