   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. Missing Metadata Handling\n",
    "\n",
    "### Error Scenario Testing\n",
    "```python\n",
    "    # Test with no metadata file\n",
    "    metadata_file.unlink()\n",
    "    orchestrator.spec_file_path = None\n",
    "    result = orchestrator.load_spec_file_path_from_metadata()\n",
    "    assert result == False  # Should return False since no metadata exists\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Missing Metadata Analysis:**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### File Removal Setup\n",
    "```python\n",
    "metadata_file.unlink()\n",
    "orchestrator.spec_file_path = None\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Clean State Preparation:**\n",
    "- **File deletion**: Remove metadata file\n",
    "- **State reset**: Clear orchestrator state\n",
    - **Missing scenario**: Simulate fresh environment\n",
    "- **Error condition**: Test failure handling\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Missing Metadata Loading\n",
    "```python\n",
    "result = orchestrator.load_spec_file_path_from_metadata()\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Error Scenario Expectations:**\n",
    "- **File not found**: Metadata file doesn't exist\n",
    "- **Graceful failure**: Should not raise exception\n",
    "- **Error indication**: Should return `False`\n",
    "- **State preservation**: Should not modify orchestrator state\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Failure Validation\n",
    "```python\n",
    "assert result == False  # Should return False since no metadata exists\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Error Handling Contract:**\n",
    "- **Boolean failure**: `False` indicates loading failure\n",
    "- **No exception**: Graceful error handling\n",
    "- **Clear indication**: Unambiguous failure signal\n",
    "- **Consistent interface**: Same boolean contract as success\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Error Handling Benefits\n",
    "**Why Test Missing Metadata?**\n",
    "- **Robustness**: System handles missing files gracefully\n",
    "- **Error recovery**: Clear failure indication\n",
    "- **Production readiness**: Real-world error scenarios\n",
    "- **User experience**: Predictable error behavior"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 7. Cleanup and Test Isolation\n",
    "\n",
    "### Manual Cleanup Strategy\n",
    "```python\n",
    "    # Cleanup\n",
    "    if metadata_file.exists():\n",
    "        metadata_file.unlink()\n",
    "    if reports_dir.exists():\n",
    "        import shutil\n",
    "        shutil.rmtree(reports_dir)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Cleanup Analysis:**\n",
    "\n",
    "#### File Cleanup\n",
    "```python\n",
    "if metadata_file.exists():\n",
    "    metadata_file.unlink()\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Conditional File Removal:**\n",
    "- **Existence check**: Only remove if file exists\n",
    "- **Safe operation**: No error if file already missing\n",
    "- **Test isolation**: Clean up after test\n",
    "- **Global resource**: Remove file from global location\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Directory Cleanup\n",
    "```python\n",
    "if reports_dir.exists():\n",
    "    import shutil\n",
    "    shutil.rmtree(reports_dir)\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Directory Removal Strategy:**\n",
    "- **Recursive deletion**: Remove entire directory tree\n",
    "- **Existence check**: Only remove if directory exists\n",
    "- **Complete cleanup**: Remove all test artifacts\n",
    "- **Global isolation**: Clean up global reports directory\n",
    "\n",
    "#### Cleanup Importance\n",
    "**Why Manual Cleanup?**\n",
    "- **Global resources**: Files created outside test workspace\n",
    "- **Test isolation**: Prevent test pollution\n",
    "- **CI/CD safety**: Clean environment for each test run\n",
    "- **Production simulation**: Real file system locations"
   ]
